            {"cmd":"text","text":"\\f[whitney]Whitney:\\c[5] Hey \\PN!"},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[whitney]\\c[5]I came here as fast as I could, but there was a lot of Rocket Team members at my Gym, so took me a while to defeat them."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[whitney]\\c[5]My Pokémon are not in condition to keep battling, I'll need to go to the Pokémon Center as fast as I can."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[whitney]\\c[5]But before that, I thought it was important to bring you this, so you can fight Team Rocket before they conclude the Radio Transmission."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"\\f[whitney]\\c[5]Take this as a recognition of your bravery."},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbGetKeyItem","args":["ZPOWERRING"]},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[whitney]\\c[5]This is a ring that allows a Trainer and their Pokémon to gather the Z-Power required to perform Z-Moves."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[whitney]\\c[5]A Z-Move is a special type of move, in which a Trainer and their Pokémon's wishes combine to unleash an attack comprising the full power of both!"
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"\\f[whitney]\\c[5]Take this as well."},
            {
              "cmd": "if",
              "cond": {"switch":997,"value":true},
              "then": [
                {
                  "cmd": "if",
                  "cond": {"script":{"call":"pbReceiveItem","args":["FIRIUMZ"]}},
                  "then": [
                    {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                    {
                      "cmd": "text",
                      "text": "\\f[whitney]\\c[5]Firium Z converts Z-Power into crystals that upgrade Fire-type moves to Fire-type Z-Moves."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "else": [
                {
                  "cmd": "if",
                  "cond": {"switch":996,"value":true},
                  "then": [
                    {
                      "cmd": "if",
                      "cond": {"script":{"call":"pbReceiveItem","args":["GRASSIUMZ"]}},
                      "then": [
                        {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                        {
                          "cmd": "text",
                          "text": "\\f[whitney]\\c[5]Grassium Z converts Z-Power into crystals that upgrade Grass-type moves to Grass-type Z-Moves."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "else": [
                    {
                      "cmd": "if",
                      "cond": {"script":{"call":"pbReceiveItem","args":["WATERIUMZ"]}},
                      "then": [
                        {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                        {
                          "cmd": "text",
                          "text": "\\f[whitney]\\c[5]Waterium Z converts Z-Power into crystals that upgrade Water-type moves to Water-type Z-Moves."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[whitney]\\c[5]You'll be able to use any Z-Move as long as your Pokémon is holding an appropriate Z-Crystal and has an appropriate move."
